  "question": {
    "text": "A car tyre is filled with nitrogen gas at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>35</mn></math>&nbsp;psi at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. It will burst if pressure exceeds <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn></math> psi. The temperature in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mo>&#8728;</mo></mmultiscripts></math>&nbsp;at which the car tyre will burst is (Rounded-off to the nearest integer)"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "70",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>40</mn><mn>35</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>300</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>342</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>857</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>69</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8771;</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p>Hence answer is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>70</mn></mfenced></math></p>"
